msgid "Create the bill from a webhook"
msgstr "Créer la facture depuis un webhook"

#. module: easyocr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:easyocr.field_res_company__easyocr_webhook_mark_paid
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:easyocr.field_res_config_settings__easyocr_webhook_mark_paid
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:easyocr.res_config_settings_view_form_easyocr
msgid "Mark the bill as paid"
msgstr "Marquer la facture comme payée"

#. module: easyocr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:easyocr.field_res_company__easyocr_webhook_payment_method_line_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:easyocr.field_res_config_settings__easyocr_webhook_payment_method_line_id
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:easyocr.res_config_settings_view_form_easyocr
msgid "Payment method"
msgstr "Mode de paiement"

#. module: easyocr
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:easyocr.res_config_settings_view_form_easyocr
msgid "Webhooks"
msgstr "Webhooks"

#. module: easyocr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:easyocr.field_res_company__easyocr_webhook_create_bill
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:easyocr.field_res_config_settings__easyocr_webhook_create_bill
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:easyocr.res_config_settings_view_form_easyocr
msgid ""
"When the service says it has finished reading a document, make the supplier "
"bill from it without waiting for anyone. Off by default: a webhook is a "
"message from outside, and a bill is an accounting entry."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque le service signale qu'il a fini de lire un document, créer la "
"facture fournisseur sans attendre personne. Désactivé par défaut : un "
"webhook est un message extérieur et une facture est une écriture comptable."

#. module: easyocr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:easyocr.field_res_company__easyocr_webhook_mark_paid
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:easyocr.field_res_config_settings__easyocr_webhook_mark_paid
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:easyocr.res_config_settings_view_form_easyocr
msgid ""
"Register the payment on the bills a webhook creates, as if the money had "
"already gone out. It only applies to a bill that is confirmed, because a "
"bill in draft has nothing to pay against."
msgstr ""
"Enregistrer le paiement sur les factures créées par un webhook, comme si "
"l'argent était déjà sorti. Cela ne s'applique qu'à une facture confirmée, "
"car un brouillon n'a rien contre quoi payer."

#. module: easyocr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:easyocr.field_res_company__easyocr_webhook_journal_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:easyocr.field_res_config_settings__easyocr_webhook_journal_id
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:easyocr.res_config_settings_view_form_easyocr
msgid "Where the payment of a webhook bill is recorded."
msgstr "Où est enregistré le paiement d'une facture créée par un webhook."

#. module: easyocr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:easyocr.field_res_company__easyocr_webhook_payment_method_line_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:easyocr.field_res_config_settings__easyocr_webhook_payment_method_line_id
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:easyocr.res_config_settings_view_form_easyocr
msgid ""
"How the payment is recorded on that bank account. Left empty, Odoo takes the"
" one the account has by default."
msgstr ""
"Comment le paiement est enregistré sur ce compte bancaire. Laissé vide, Odoo"
" prend celui que le compte a par défaut."

#. module: easyocr
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/easyocr/models/easyocr_document.py:0
